Execute right after w-24a7 lands, about 06:00Z:
- check the checkout is clean (HEAD ee2f21c6, branch master);
- fast-forward only;
- back up the old binary target/release/termal, sha f528f85d…;
- build;
- report the sha and the master commit.
Stop if it's not a clean fast-forward. Record on the item (w-24a7, or w-e072 for the Questly Linux proof) with Greg's word.
